                    "「蛋糕是试做品,还让你吃完给了感想,这样可算不上登窑那份人情",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "的谢礼呢」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00230",
        linknext = "block_00232"
    },
    block_00232 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「谢礼啦人情啦,不用在意那些吧」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00231",
        linknext = "block_00233"
    },
    block_00233 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1a0910", face = "a0006", head = "mak_z1a", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"fgact", ch = "真琴", act = "うなづく", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001816", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「那可不行」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00232",
        linknext = "block_00234"
    },
    block_00234 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「那,给我看内裤吧」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00233",
        linknext = "block_00235"
    },
    block_00235 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1a0910", face = "a0015", head = "mak_z1a", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001817", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「又来?」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00234",
        linknext = "block_00236"
    },
    block_00236 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"鸟谷倒也没生气,只是发出无奈的声音。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00235",
        linknext = "block_00237"
    },
    block_00237 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1a0900", face = "a0016", head = "mak_z1a", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001818", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「以前,也在这里有过类似的对话呢」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00236",
        linknext = "block_00238"
    },
    block_00238 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「你还记得啊,我以为你早忘了」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00237",
        linknext = "block_00239"
    },
    block_00239 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1a0900", face = "a0017", head = "mak_z1a", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001819", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「忘不掉啊……。毕竟是关于草薙的印象深刻的插曲……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00238",
        linknext = "block_00240"
    },
    block_00240 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「啊,那次虽然让人失望,但也非常美好。要是就那样,这么……把裙子",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "撩起来,就能看到内裤了」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00239",
        linknext = "block_00241"
    },
    block_00241 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「从穿着女仆装、满脸羞涩的鸟谷的裙下露出的内裤。那可不是普",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "通的内裤,是一种特别的内裤感」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00240",
        linknext = "block_00242"
    },
    block_00242 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1d0900", face = "d0015", head = "mak_z1d", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001820", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「内裤内裤的,再念下去,内裤这个词都要格式塔崩坏了」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00241",
        linknext = "block_00243"
    },
    block_00243 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1d0900", face = "d0001", head = "mak_z1d", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001821", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「嗯……不过,内裤确实是特别的,我承认」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00242",
        linknext = "block_00244"
    },
    block_00244 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「诶,是这样吗」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00243",
        linknext = "block_00245"
    },
    block_00245 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"没想到居然能得到鸟谷的理解。不由自主地,身体噌地向前倾去。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00244",
        linknext = "block_00246"
    },
    block_00246 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z2", mode = 3, resize = 1, path = ":fg/mak/z2/", file = "mak_z2d0900", face = "d0001", head = "mak_z2d", lv = 5, id = 9},
        {"quake", mode = "mw"},
        {"se", file = "se3214", id = 1},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「你懂我!　那、那么」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00245",
        linknext = "block_00247"
    },
    block_00247 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z2", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z2/", file = "mak_z2a0910", face = "a0018", head = "mak_z2a", lv = 5, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        delay = {
            vl01 = {
                {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z2", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z2/", file = "mak_z2a0910", face = "a0005", head = "mak_z2a", lv = 5, id = 9}
            }
        },
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001822", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「想什么呢。正因为内裤是特别的,所以,没有特别的对象或特别的",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "理由,就不会给人看。是这个意思」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00246",
        linknext = "block_00248"
    },
    block_00248 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "内裤之壁太厚重了。不,这种情况下,该说不是内裤而是裙子吗。铁",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "壁裙子吗。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00247",
        linknext = "block_00249"
    },
    block_00249 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「那,让我画裸体素描吧」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00248",
        linknext = "block_00250"
    },
    block_00250 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z2", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z2/", file = "mak_z2d0900", face = "d0013", head = "mak_z2d", lv = 5, id = 9},
        {"fgact", ch = "真琴", act = "びっくり", lv = 5, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        delay = {
            vl01 = {
                {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z2", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z2/", file = "mak_z2d0900", face = "d0008", head = "mak_z2d", lv = 5, id = 9}
            }
        },
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001823", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「怎么从内裤跳到裸体了!?　难度不是更上一层楼了吗!」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00249",
        linknext = "block_00251"
    },
    block_00251 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「谁让你说,有特别的理由就给我看内裤」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00250",
        linknext = "block_00252"
    },
    block_00252 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z2", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z2/", file = "mak_z2d0900", face = "d0006", head = "mak_z2d", lv = 5, id = 9},
        {"fgact", ch = "真琴", act = "うなづく", lv = 5, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001824", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「裸体和内裤根本是两码事,再说那种事怎么可能答应!」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00251",
        linknext = "block_00253"
    },
    block_00253 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"唔——不行吗。遗憾。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00252",
        linknext = "block_00254"
    },
    block_00254 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, resize = 1, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1d0900", face = "d0006", head = "mak_z1d", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「开玩笑的。基本上,我不会把那种冲动带进画里」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00253",
        linknext = "block_00255"
    },
    block_00255 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1a0900", face = "a0001", head = "mak_z1a", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001825", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「你这是全盘否定雷诺阿呢」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00254",
        linknext = "block_00256"
    },
    block_00256 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「不,了解绘画史的人都知道,性爱与艺术是紧密交叠在一起的。只",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "是,我不行」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00255",
        linknext = "block_00257"
    },
    block_00257 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1a0900", face = "a0012", head = "mak_z1a", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001826", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「为什么?」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00256",
        linknext = "block_00258"
    },
    block_00258 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「谁、谁知道呢……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00257",
        linknext = "block_00259"
    },
    block_00259 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1a0910", face = "a0017", head = "mak_z1a", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        delay = {
            vl01 = {
                {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1d0910", face = "d0006", head = "mak_z1d", lv = 4, id = 9},
                {"fgact", ch = "真琴", act = "うなづく", lv = 4, id = 9}
            }
        },
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001827", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「你在隐瞒什么。肯定有什么理由吧!」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00258",
        linknext = "block_00260"
    },
    block_00260 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「没有。没有。什么理由都没有。我是童贞所以画不了裸体素描,就",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "这样」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00259",
        linknext = "block_00261"
    },
    block_00261 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1d0900", face = "d0015", head = "mak_z1d", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"fgact", ch = "真琴", act = "おじぎ", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        delay = {
            vl01 = {
                {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1d0900", face = "d0005", head = "mak_z1d", lv = 4, id = 9}
            }
        },
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001828", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「唉,净撒谎,接受过草薙健一郎精英教育的你,怎么可能没画过裸体",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "素描」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00260",
        linknext = "block_00262"
    },
    block_00262 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「嘛,确实画过,不过模特基本都是不认识的人……还有,对我来说素描",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "是种非常机械性的作业」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00261",
        linknext = "block_00263"
    },
    block_00263 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1a0900", face = "a0026", head = "mak_z1a", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        delay = {
            vl01 = {
                {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1a0900", face = "a0006", head = "mak_z1a", lv = 4, id = 9}
            }
        },
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001829", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「这也是谎话。你的素描,可不是做机械性作业的人画出来的。要把",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "人的表情、内心,画得像凝视进去了一般,必须思考很多很多东西才",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "行」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00262",
        linknext = "block_00264"
    },
    block_00264 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「当然,作为构成作品的要素,我确实画过将素描对象以展现内心的",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "方式呈现的画。但那终归是作为构成作品的要素。并不存在描绘对",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "象内心这回事」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00263",
        linknext = "block_00265"
    },
    block_00265 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1a0900", face = "a0008", head = "mak_z1a", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001830", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「什么意思?　我不太明白」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00264",
        linknext = "block_00266"
    },
    block_00266 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「印象派画家埃德加·德加的作品,通过描绘的表情,映照出对象内心,",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "这是很有名的故事」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00265",
        linknext = "block_00267"
    },
    block_00267 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「他那过于锐利的观察力,甚至曾经触怒过他的朋友马奈」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00266",
        linknext = "block_00268"
    },
    block_00268 = {
        {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1a0900", face = "a0012", head = "mak_z1a", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"fgact", ch = "真琴", act = "うなづく", lv = 4, id = 9},
        {"text"},
        delay = {
            vl01 = {
                {"fg", ch = "真琴", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/mak/z1/", file = "mak_z1a0900", face = "a0001", head = "mak_z1a", lv = 4, id = 9}
            }
        },
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_mkd_001831", ch = "mkd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"真琴"},
                    "「啊,我知道,那个。『马奈与马奈夫人像』。那幅作品是德加送给",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "马奈的,结果马奈居然把弹钢琴的夫人部分连画布一起裁掉了」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00267",
        linknext = "block_00269"
    },
    block_00269 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「你知道得还真不少。被裁掉的夫人部分成了永远的谜,不过据说原",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "因就在于,德加锐利的观察眼,通过表情揭示了那对夫妇的关系」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00268",
        linknext = "block_00270"
    },
    block_00270 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「德加的观察眼,就是锐利到这种地步」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00269",
        linknext = "block_00271"
    },
    block_00271 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「但是,比如他的代表作『舞蹈教室(芭蕾教室)』,虽然是那样一幅临",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "场感十足的作品,却并不是在芭蕾教室里写生出来的」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00270",
        linknext = "block_00272"
    },
    block_00272 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「那是把模特一个一个单独素描,事后再周密地安排布局而成的」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00271",
        linknext = "block_00273"
    },
    block_00273 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「舞蹈教室里流动的独特氛围,神情紧张地望着教师的人、窃窃私语",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "的人、一脸无聊的人,还有前排的少女,挠着后背,压根没在听教师讲",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "话」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00272",
        linknext = "block_00274"
    },
    block_00274 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「但是,那种空气感,并不是把感受到的东西照原样画下来。完全是",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "经过计算营造出来的」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00273",
        linknext = "block_00275"
    },
    block_00275 = {
